Z||000000||Motorhead||12-26-2000||05:04 PM||||The third car is on the way and I'm not quite sure why I love this little car so much!!<BR>I bought my first in 1984, brand new demo!  Bought it from a "good friend" Pontiac Salesman. DUUUHHH!  There's a contradiction in terms.  "Friend,Car Salesman!!!"<BR>$316.00 monthly in payments!  Unheard of in 1984! There was a waiting list for one from the factory!  But I owned one of the first! <BR>My newlywed wife brought it home one nite with grass stains on the left front!! Think about it!  Seems a 911 Porsche insulted her!<BR>Guess it had the same grass stains on the left rear!!Something about "allways leave the road backwards"!<P>Many years and many cars later, I find a little red Fiero in the driveway,with an '84 by its side! My next project is an '86 automatic for the wife!  She wants an '84 <BR>like my original! But I know better now!<BR>She's getting an '86 automatic!<P>Cars are like close friends.  "They're always there whether you want them or <BR>not"!!!!<P>Let me tell you about my Sunbeam Alpines sometime!!!<P>Mike<P>||||reg||1
